# AI Security Scanner

An AI-powered Python security analysis tool that uses Google's Gemini API to review Python source code, identify potential security vulnerabilities, and generate remediation recommendations.

## Overview

AI Security Scanner helps developers identify common security weaknesses in Python applications through AI-assisted source code analysis.

The scanner reviews Python files and checks for potential vulnerabilities such as:

- SQL Injection
- Command Injection
- Weak Password Hashing
- Hardcoded Credentials
- Path Traversal
- Insecure File Handling
- Unsafe Deserialization
- Missing Input Validation

## Features

- AI-powered Python source code analysis
- Gemini API integration
- Security vulnerability identification
- Severity classification
- Remediation recommendations
- Secure code suggestions
- Text-based security audit report
- Automatic report generation

## Technology Stack

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Python | Application development |
| Google Gemini API | AI security analysis |
| Google Gen AI SDK | Gemini API integration |
| Python-dotenv | Environment configuration |
| CMD | Project execution |

